                        


Scp-xxxx

Class: Keter Neutralized

Special Containment Procedures:

The plot of land containing SCP-xxxx was bought by the SCP Foundation on █/██ 1984, and has since been neutralized. Dispite this, the area once containing SCP-xxxx is to be remotely monitored for any unforeseen occurrences or events. Any significant changes or events are to be reported to Level 5 personnel immediately. All entrances to the inside of SCP-xxxx have been gated off. These gates are only able to be opened by level 3 personnel or higher. To uphold the cover story for SCP-xxxx, several restaurants and businesses have been set up along the perimeter of the outer walls. Staff for said restaurants and businesses have been hired by the Foundation to run these businesses. Persons attempting to gain access to the inside of the SCP-xxxx are to be reprimanded by several security staff dressed as gang members. These persons are to be kidnapped, blindfolded, drugged with GHB, and given Class A amnestics before being returned to current place of residence. If place of residence is occupied by family member(s), the person shall be left outdoors in a reasonably safe area to wake from GHB. Said area is to be no further than 3 mile away from place of residence.

Description:

SCP-xxxx was a clutter of buildings in Hong Kong measuring approximately 6.4 square acres. SCP-xxxx was discovered by the SCP Foundation when an urban explorer known as 31 year old Seol ██████ went inside SCP-xxxx for approximately 4 hours, and came out aged at approximately 80 years old. Seol died on █/██, 2009 while in Foundation custody. Upon discovery of SCP-xxxx, the Foundation immediately bought out the plot of land containing SCP-xxxx, and a cover story for SCP-xxxx was formulated, describing SCP-xxxx as an ungoverned, dangerous settlement called the Kowloon walled city. Hidden security cameras were built into several outer parts of the building to allow surveillance of the area. Although it has since been demolished, the park built over the plot of land once containing SCP-xxxx is currently being monitored 24/7 for any strange events or occurrences.

                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    

                    
                    
                        
